<p>Madrid Airport's Terminal 4 sits noticeably further from the city than Terminals 1, 2, and 3, so the drive time can vary by several minutes depending on where you're flying from. A driver who regularly covers this route factors the terminal into the pickup timing rather than treating all four as an identical trip, which matters if your connection from Atocha is already tight.</p>
